%% title: `fetch nudges`
%% summary: Snapshot advisory-nudge fetch without draining.
%% commentary: This snapshot path should read the current queued nudge state without draining it and keep client naming out of daemon ownership.
%% sets: client
flowchart TD
    A[registered-consumer fetch request] --> B[Daemon fetch handler]
    B --> C1[Locate consumer session]
    C1 -->|not found| E1[ValidationFailed or NotFound]
    C1 --> C2[Read bounded advisory-nudge queue snapshot]
    C2 -->|runtime error| E2[DaemonUnavailable]
    C2 --> O1[Return queued nudges without draining]
